
Create Network Interface (eth1 static)
    nmcli device status #list devices
    sudo nmcli con add type ethernet ifname enp0s25 con-name static-lan ipv4.method manual ipv4.addresses 192.168.2.100/24 ipv4.gateway 192.168.2.1 ipv4.dns 8.8.8.8
    
    Activate
        sudo nmcli con up static-lan
        nmcli con show static-lan
        ip addr show enp0s25


